{'symbol': 'JNPR', 'date': '2022-06-08 23:00:00', 'title': "XL AXIATA PARTNERS WITH JUNIPER NETWORKS TO ACCELERATE THE ROLLOUT OF 5G SERVICES TO SUPPORT INDONESIA'S DIGITAL ECONOMY", 'text': "JAKARTA, INDONESIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--JUNIPER NETWORKS (NYSE: JNPR), A LEADER IN SECURE, AI-DRIVEN NETWORKS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT XL AXIATA, ONE OF THE LEADING MOBILE TELECOMMUNICATIONS COMPANIES IN INDONESIA, WILL IMPLEMENT JUNIPER'S SEGMENT ROUTING OVER IPV6 (SRV6) AND MX SERIES UNIVERSAL ROUTING PLATFORMS TO ENHANCE ITS EXISTING NETWORK INFRASTRUCTURE. WITH UPGRADES FROM JUNIPER, XL AXIATA WILL HAVE A STRONGER NETWORKING FOUNDATION TO SUPPORT THE GROWING DEMAND FOR 5G SERVICES AND INDONESIA'S"}